OL,3,GNEWSARare Star Wars double lightsaber
OL,4,Afigure for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Star Wars figure featuring a rare
OL,7,Fdouble telescoping lightsaber is
OL,8,Fexpected to fetch up to #20,000 at
OL,9,Fauction.
OL,11,FThe Luke Skywalker model portrays the
OL,12,Fcharacter as a farm boy and was
OL,13,Freleased in 1977 to celebrate the
OL,14,Flaunch of the original franchise movie
OL,15,FA New Hope.
OL,17,FThe figure is considered rare because
OL,18,Fit features a yellow lightsaber barrel
OL,19,Fwith a second, thinner blade concealed
OL,20,Fwithin it, allowing the weapon to
OL,21,Fextend to a longer length, according to
OL,22,Fauctioneers.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
